    "type": "paragraph",
    "snippet": "Stiles Switch BBQ offers great neighborhood barbecue with short wait times, while Franklin Barbecue serves world-class, legendary brisket that requires waiting in line for hours.",
    "snippet_highlighted_words": [
     "Stiles Switch BBQ offers great neighborhood barbecue with short wait times, while Franklin Barbecue serves world-class, legendary brisket that requires waiting in line for hours"
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "heading",
    "snippet": "Franklin Barbecue"
   },
   {
    "type": "list",
    "list": [
     {
      "snippet": "The Experience: Iconic and world-famous. You must arrive early in the morning (often 7:00 AM or 8:00 AM) to wait in a legendary line that lasts hours before they sell out by mid-afternoon."
     },
     {
      "snippet": "The Food: Widely considered the gold standard for Texas brisket, featuring an exceptional bark, melt-in-your-mouth fat render, and deep smoke flavor."
     },
     {
      "snippet": "Hours: Tuesday through Sunday from 11:00 AM to 3:00 PM (or until sold out)."
     },
     {
      "snippet": "Location: 900 East 11th Street, Austin, TX."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "heading",
    "snippet": "Stiles Switch BBQ"
   },
   {
    "type": "list",
    "list": [
     {
      "snippet": "The Experience: Relaxed, neighborhood joint. Lines are much shorter, move quickly, and rarely sell out instantly, making it a stress-free lunch or dinner option."
     },
     {
      "snippet": "The Food: High-quality \"Texas Trinity\" (brisket, ribs, sausage) and classic sides like corn casserole and potato salad, though purists consider it a step below Franklin's elite tier."
     },
     {
      "snippet": "Hours: Tuesday through Thursday and Sunday from 11:00 AM to 8:00 PM, Friday and Saturday from 11:00 AM to 8:30 PM."
     },
     {
      "snippet": "Location: 6610 North Lamar Boulevard, Austin, TX (with an expansion location in Cedar Park and a sister restaurant, The Switch, in Dripping Springs)."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "snippet": "Are you planning a trip to Austin and trying to decide which one fits your schedule, or would you like recommendations for other spots that balance great food with a manageable wait?"
   }
